{
  "project": "井口真理子命案：她没能回家",
  "voice_id": "voice-02",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "报道指，她走出高雄车站后失踪，亲友再无音讯。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "474969c6fd24317fe4240c2cb53cc486464e065c0fa3392c0a61d1bf014ba8ae",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "她离开车站后去了哪里？公开资料没有答案。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "29e248b288bca6440c17209178a4a9561df49d305b4ce966290a25f8bf537826",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九九〇年四月，她从日本独自飞来台湾，开始毕业旅行。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "73a77fd885a1945a4dcf30fbf8e4f5bdb0d77a082e6e6af8f00ff423e1a86c6b",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "夜市人声与锅气交织，她在摊边小本写下所见，留下旅途心情。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "0246b4b3ce98eb583904af1573684912612037213762ada794993b3c662a157c",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "媒体回顾提到，李姓司机曾接待她，也邀她在家里借宿。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "8c86b8b982723968fdd3519c7fc1233b1d6471ef1b6e9815e4de513fb92fa2fb",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "媒体回顾称，她曾写下明信片，向远方家人报平安。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "9b6b7d386fbd55d538c3e9e7fdb4c8694b9328de4904b6198718e81aab74abba",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "媒体记载，四月七日清晨，李姓司机送她到台南车站；她随后南下。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "8fbf0c0a375dc114d1c6bc3ad9f03aa52307f7a663875f6470e59f5b7bd8e613",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "车窗外稻田不断后退，她手里仍握着明信片，沿途光影掠过窗边。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "6398c5febc880a4e7cad4ef286d5f77fa7ff2fe919fcbd1da36c6c7e18bea6a1",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，她随后抵达高雄车站；此后，她的行踪难以确认。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "15a683d74adae7036712d63b3e4786c16f4222f5a74221361c6e00e0a8dea9f1",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "报道指，她原定四月十八日返日，最终未登机。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "0ad52b687ab85f88968ca30270bee928581ed68137a61ab8226e25b4320fc2a2",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "四月二十五日，母亲久子抵台寻人，手中一直攥着女儿的照片。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "0007daea5f9c3140a4d90e690fbadf95bd1ca06411f36b4f907d483db9c2f200",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "媒体记载，她久等不到返日消息，前往警方求助；警方随后成立专案。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "8792bcd344ddd5d3fcb28bfadc1257141b66f2737a04eb1a43c3a4a335faf659",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，李姓司机接受调查后获释；警方另寻线索。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "998dc092ae799a93f0d265ca843a9b36cc85f1e55150fda27c525c4348e41487",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "报道记载，墓园、甘蔗田均曾搜寻，仍无结果。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "96c8293d1b862c346e6b7cb52c6e5e53365802a902d1cd1f47d025ff4816bb6a",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "媒体记载，一九九一年三月四日，警方在高雄逮捕刘学强。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "24ce476260897899f371fe3581dd8d862c863b79027104e06514fa47f8b8c802",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "媒体转述的供述称，他在车站看见她，随后上前搭话。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "3029ed5fbff8cf00573eb1f9ec689c7b1c27c9bf1bb1b296a889032a6d9a15ab",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "据媒体转述，其供述称白天曾带她游览景点；这只是他的说法。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "91edff948e8b415961ce2c7d6a096afffdb9993a0c10d4ec39e5dc77556bb216",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "媒体回顾仅转述供述；案发夜细节不作画面复原。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "b21edd300883079414b8909a02a732d7bd6724416afb4e784b1d09ce5f937f08",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "媒体曾提及那只深蓝色背包；其具体去向，本片不作推断。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "46fa4c813ee13004741879ac3a349bdaa22676291e46956c2621ee5317edcbff",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "媒体回顾称，供述几经变化，警方必须逐一核查每个线索。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": "039e1540434d6106022aeb7d512734763d963795cd8094e8f0de48d05bcf86ce",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "报道指出，弃置地点说法多次变化，搜寻一度受阻。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "媒体记载，警方依供述逐一核查多个地点。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，三月七日深夜，组长王家儒单独留下，与他谈了很久。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "媒体回忆，警车一夜往返台南、高雄，多处搜索仍然落空，天色渐亮。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "报道转述，谈到唯一的儿子后，他沉默良久，终于说出地点。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "报道记载，三月九日清晨，警方挖出一百多块骨骸。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "报道记载，身份确认后，母亲后来见到女儿留下的遗物。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "据供述，头颅被垃圾车运走；掩埋场的后续搜寻最终停止。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "一九九三年，母亲带着女儿的骨灰返日；刘学强被判无期。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "二〇二六年初报道：假释未获准；官方现况待核。",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    }
  ],
  "target_duration": 180,
  "alignment": "one sentence per Agnes clip"
}
